g and whisking away anyone who dare threaten it. She looks very kind and motherly on the outside but she is actually quite sadistic underneath her facade. At least she tries to be. She seems like she's glaring when her eyes are open but it's actually because she has poor eyesight. Often walks into things.\nFeel free to draw her however you wish based on that. Maybe with some plants or vines.\nI look forward to your work!\n\nSerena: https://photos.app.goo.gl/pCuv9P8oWxvMjw5h6", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@takaashiganii/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2425536, "client_id": 3040707, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83102c78/uploads/origins/f44293ba-d0de-48fb-bace-359b1462627e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff44a61593edf1a1409a7d79f4f30356", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83102c78/uploads/origins/f44293ba-d0de-48fb-bace-359b1462627e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff44a61593edf1a1409a7d79f4f30356, https://si.imgix.net/83102c78/uploads/origins/f44293ba-d0de-48fb-bace-359b1462627e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=06feda2be51c29d5d4679d84ecf4f77c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83102c78/uploads/origins/f44293ba-d0de-48fb-bace-359b1462627e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a9fcc326f0c4cd273eb16a72079c6d9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83102c78/uploads/origins/f44293ba-d0de-48fb-bace-359b1462627e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c99856a07a5a42a78b58c281e4f5422b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83102c78/uploads/origins/f44293ba-d0de-48fb-bace-359b1462627e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr